    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Body Control Sphere; Berserker Sphere or one of bloodrage, rage, or raging song class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have a meditation active, you do not suffer a penalty to AC from using berserking, bloodrage, rage, or raging song.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc80\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
